<title>USA: TF Financial stake held by Cramer group.</title>
<headline>TF Financial stake held by Cramer group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investor James Cramer said Wednesday it holds a five percent stake in TF Financial Corp or 215,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 65,000 common shares between March 31 and May 5 at prices ranging from $16.8750 to $17.75 per share.</p>
<p>TF Financial, based in Newton, Pa., is a holding company for Third Federal Savings Bank.</p>
